neighborhoodComplements -- complements the neighborhood for each vertex, individually
*************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        N' = neighborhoodComplements L
        N = neighborhoodComplements S
        N = neighborhoodComplements G
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, containing graphs in various
        formats
      * S, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, a graph encoded in either
        Sparse6 or Graph6 format
      * G, a *note graph: (EdgeIdeals)Graph,, 
  * Outputs:
      * N', a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, containing graphs in either
        Graph6 or Sparse6 format, modified as described below
      * N, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, containing graphs, in the same
        format as the input, modified as described below

Description
===========

The method creates a list of graphs, one for each vertex of the original graph
$G$.  The graph associated to a vertex $v$ of $G$ has the neighborhood of $v$
complemented.

The method does not remove isomorphs.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..e];                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : neighborhoodComplements graph {a*b, a*c, b*c, c*d, d*e}                 |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {b, c}, {b, d}, {b, e}, {c, e}, {d,  |
|            "ring" => R                                                      |
|            "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                    |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     e}}}, Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {b, c}, {a, d}, {a, e}, {c, e}, |
|                 "ring" => R                                                 |
|                 "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                               |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {d, e}}}, Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {b, c}, {c, d}, {a, e}, {b, |
|                     "ring" => R                                             |
|                     "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                           |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     e}}}, Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {c, d}, {a, e}, {b, e}, {d, e}}},       |
|                 "ring" => R                                                 |
|                 "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                               |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {b, c}, {a, d}, {b, d}, {d, e}}}}     |
|           "ring" => R                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

